{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39263078"}, "name":{"label":"Ecaus"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-11T07:53:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13738031343"}, "title":{"label":"Just what I needed"}, "content":{"label":"Ive searched a lot of todo apps and  deleted them all after trying them.\nI even designed and developed my own pwa todo which worked perfectly but i found myself always improving it versus doing the other tasks. the oroblem was that no todo apps matched the way my mind operated so I always felt friction in using them.\nthat is until I tried again and found  structured. and it is no mental friction and just what i needed. its ui and ux is structure not imprisonment. and thats powerful\nid love to share some iseas wirh the developers that i used with my app  if they are up for it\nbut i love this and Im thankful for it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id963168755"}, "name":{"label":"not-existent"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T23:35:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13736749699"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, small bug"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app, despite how limited the base is without paying for it. Right now, i’m experiencing an annoying bug (?), everytime i try to move a task already added on my timeline, it always shoots back to where it originally was. It used to not do that, and it’s really frustrating right now. Please fix it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id522722652"}, "name":{"label":"XoBommie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T08:56:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13734655463"}, "title":{"label":"Typical pay for every feature app"}, "content":{"label":"You have to pay to repeat so unless you want to update your planner everyday with the same task/reminder id suggest looking for another app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id139136972"}, "name":{"label":"Sdlynn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T07:54:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13734466803"}, "title":{"label":"Transforming Time Management with Color, Clarity, and Compassion"}, "content":{"label":"As a mental health coach, staying organized and engaged is essential for supporting my clients and managing my online presence. Structured has been a game-changer for me! The vibrant colors make planning enjoyable and keep me motivated throughout the day. I love how easy it is to track my time and daily activities, which helps me stay on top of client sessions, content creation, and online engagement.\n\nI also love recommending Structured to clients with ADD/ADHD—the colorful, visual layout helps them stay engaged and better understand how their time is “structured”😉. One of the most valuable aspects is how it allows both me and my clients to realistically assess our schedules. By visually mapping out our days, we can identify when we might be setting unrealistic expectations for ourselves and make adjustments to ensure our plans are actually achievable in today’s fast-paced world.\n\nI’m especially excited to explore the AI features to further streamline my workflow. Highly recommended for professionals and anyone looking to boost productivity, maintain a strong online presence, and approach time management with greater self-compassion and realism!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
