{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1638067545"}, "name":{"label":"Ahmad.aram"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-07T06:56:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13723283214"}, "title":{"label":"Habit tracking"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy using this app. It has helped me learn and stay consistent, and the experience is smooth and motivating. However, I would love to see a habit tracking feature added in the future.\n\nA habit tracker would help users monitor their daily progress, stay consistent, and build long-term routines. For example, tracking how many days in a row I practice, setting daily goals, and seeing progress statistics would be extremely helpful and motivating.\n\nThis feature would make the app even more powerful and useful for users who want to improve consistently. I hope you consider adding habit tracking in a future update. Thank you for your great work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
