{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id280193994"}, "name":{"label":"aspeechie123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-04T18:44:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13714083990"}, "title":{"label":"I love it here!!!"}, "content":{"label":"This app has changes my life in the best way possible. There are so many details that I love about this app that I don’t know where to begin. I don’t do well with change and recently there has been a format/design change. I thought I’d struggle to adjust but I ended up loving it. I love everything down to the color and the app icon ca be changed to one’s liking. I’m not great with time management so I love that it tells you exactly how much time you have between tasks/appointments. I could go on and on about this app. I tried out several different planner/scheduling apps before deciding which was best for me and this was by for the best.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id85385977"}, "name":{"label":"LustianoAmericano"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-04T14:34:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13713471020"}, "title":{"label":"Love being Structured!"}, "content":{"label":"Been using structured for awhile now.  The whole family has.  We don’t always use it for planning my whole day out but it’s a great app in the arsenal and is a big help when I do use it.  The interface makes it easy to plug stuff and the customizations are perfect.  Been using the built in AI for my most recent round of planning (have a new and busy schedule for February) and it works well.  Whenever my kids have issues staying on task or want to start a new routine I always tell them to open up Structured and create a schedule that makes sense.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
