{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1689610037"}, "name":{"label":"Sara J.__"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-01T08:01:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"13701359848"}, "title":{"label":"Everything disappeared last week…"}, "content":{"label":"I loved this app and had it replace a physical planner that I used for years. I paid for it so I could have recurring events. I was sad to see that the app is completely empty right now, not even showing the times/tasks. Everything that I spent so much time entering is gone. I restarted/redownloaded and still nothing. I hope this doesn’t happen to anyone else.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
