{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id396350380"}, "name":{"label":"Akrempl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-31T08:58:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"13697552602"}, "title":{"label":"Search Function"}, "content":{"label":"I love the Structured app because if I put \"all day\" I can see all of my appointments for the day and kind of a banner fashion, but I do not like the fact that I cannot search for a specific appointment or event while only using the app. I am paying for Pro. This feature is supposed to be coming in the future, but I really think it should be prioritized. I will be happy to adjust my stars and my review when this issue is resolved. this app is excellent for just looking at what is happening in the next week or so, but when looking for something in the future – – an appointment that has been made, it is lacking.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
