{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id118515936"}, "name":{"label":"RMKEIII"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-30T06:06:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"13693018170"}, "title":{"label":"No demo? no calendar?"}, "content":{"label":"I get what they're going for. I like the idea. It's simple, etc. but with no demo/walkthrough, or it guiding you through your first few days planning seems like a big miss to me. It's not very intuitive, so a guide would help. Second issue is no calendar to look ahead? What's coming up this week? This month? It's just task by task day by day. Nice when that's how your brain works, but I need the ability to look forward and structure my week.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
